---
component: keepsake
# A crew member hands Ilo a keepsake: record the gift (the sea-chest offers it
# from then on) and say where it went.
effects: true
params:
  who: speaker
  item: { enum: [compass, lantern, shell] }
---

## Keepsake

::assert{gifted(@who, @item)}
@narrator: Ilo stows {{@who}}'s {{@item}} in the sea-chest at the stern.
